[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/comments/6287833218","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300#issuecomment-6287833218","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/300","id":6287833218,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABdsi4gg","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-20T09:27:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T09:27:09Z","body":"【Claude】容量 512 之前要先處理：載入成本的剩餘超線性(2026-10-20 量測)\n\n背景:GEO-261 的載入效能修正(#321,`geometry-core/kernel/source.c` 改成雜湊索引)把 N=64 的載入從 main 的 31.8× 降到 1.94×,通過了 GEO-261 合併門檻 P-189(≤2×)。不過 fix/main 這個比值仍會隨 N 上升:N=16 是 0.90×,32 是 1.18×,48 是 1.56×,64 是 1.94×。依這個趨勢，容量放到 512 之後會嚴重超標。\n\n**呼叫次數的成長**(gprof,`-O1 -fno-inline -pg`,single 家族場景，原始輸出在 `D:/geometry-axiom-work/load-profile-*`):\n\n| 函式 | fix N=32 | fix N=64 | 倍數(N 加倍) | main N=64 |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| `geo_eval_source` | 450,098 | 2,980,967 | 6.6×(約 N^2.7) | 不存在 |\n| `wd_read` | 5,922,136 | 43,503,376 | 7.3×(約 N^2.9) | 不存在 |\n| `contact_order` | 354,308 | 2,729,508 | 7.7× | 內嵌在 `collect_stop_faces` |\n| `wood_contact_collect_stops` / `collect_stop_faces` | 3,438 | 12,942 | 3.8×(約 N^1.9) | 12,924 |\n| `reference_member_footprint` | — | 141,429 | — | 不存在 |\n\n**解讀**\n- 擋面收集的呼叫次數和 main 一樣(12,942 對 12,924)。main 的 `collect_stop_faces` 本身也是每次 O(N²)~O(N³),在 main 的取樣裡占 56%。所以這部分是兩邊共有的成本，不是 GEO-261 才有。\n- GEO-261 多出來的是來源圖求值，次數約 N^2.7:每次驗證都會為每支角材重新解析 footprint(`reference_member_footprint`),每個 footprint 又要讀約 20 個來源。\n- 可能的方向(還沒做，也還沒驗證等價性):\n  - 在同一個候選內記憶化角材 footprint 的來源求值;\n  - 把 `contact_order` 的線性查找改成依 id 直接索引;\n  - 擋面收集的排序和去重改成 O(N log N)。\n  \n  前兩項只動 W/K 的資料結構，不涉及 P-177 禁止的守門流量。\n\n**提議**:把這三項列為 #300 實作前的前置工作。門檻沿用 P-189 的寫法:N=128/256/512 每一點都 ≤ 2 × main(main 要先套用容量補丁才能量到 N>64),並且 dump 逐位元組相同。\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/comments/6287833218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]